LOCATION:St. Coloman Kirche\, Schwangau
DESCRIPTION:Schwangau's biggest traditional festival honouring St. Coloman\
 , with around 200 decorated horses. The procession leaves the Rathaus at 9
 :30 behind the Musikkapelle Schwangau and moves to the field mass at the p
 ilgrimage church St. Coloman\, followed by the horse blessing with the Col
 oman relic and the ceremonial ride around the church. A second devotion wi
 th individual blessings follows at 15:00. Food and drink stalls\, free to 
 attend.
