  Mel Bonis and her era. Dorothee Gurski (cello) and Annette Naumann (piano
 ) play Bonis's Sonata for cello and piano and her Serenade\, Saint-Saëns'
 s The Swan\, Fauré's Berceuse and Sicilienne\, and Boulanger's Trois piè
 ces. Premiere\; repeats 6 February 19:00 and 7 February 18:00. 24 EUR\, sm
 all studio stage.
